# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# MediGemma Field - Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# This app is 100% on-device. It uses Gemma 4 E2B (Apache 2.0) via
# flutter_gemma 0.14.5. There is no backend, no API, no telemetry.
#
# ── Production / hackathon submission APK ───────────────────────
#
# Leave THIS FILE COMPLETELY EMPTY (or do not ship it at all).
# Gemma 4 is downloaded anonymously from HuggingFace — no token,
# no account, no credentials needed.
#
# Why no embedded credentials?
#   - APK files are zip archives — anyone can extract embedded values
#   - Eliminating credentials eliminates an entire class of security
#     concerns (key extraction, quota drain, billing fraud)
#   - Gemma 4's Apache 2.0 license + HuggingFace's public CDN make
#     anonymous distribution possible
#
# ── Development (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────
#
# HF_TOKEN: Optional HuggingFace read token.
#   - NOT required for Gemma 4 download (verified 2026-05-09:
#     anonymous download returns HTTP 200 with X-Xet-Cas-Uid=public)
#   - May help avoid HuggingFace rate limits during heavy dev testing
#   - Generate at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens (Read scope)
#   - NEVER commit .env (already in .gitignore)
#
# Setup:
#   1. cp .env.example .env
#   2. (Optional) Add HF_TOKEN for dev convenience
#   3. For release builds, ensure .env is empty or absent
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

HF_TOKEN=
